  triage:title "ADR-047 number collision" ;
  triage:description "docs/adr/ADR-047-durable-idle-search-projection.md registers as ADR-047, but this number is already claimed by forward references in Phase AK planning docs (ADR-047 was supposed to define direct trusted-LAN HTTP peer transport). The AQ conversion commit (a760a473d) landed a new ADR-047 without confirming Phase AK's ADR renumbering actually happened first. ADR-047 now collides with forward-referenced number in docs/adr/INDEX.md and other Phase AK documentation." ;
